{{!
    @template theme_dimensions/navbar_guest

    The visitor's actions at the right end of the navbar, in place of core's "Log in" link and its
    "You are currently using guest access" sentence. The theme's core renderer appends the rendered
    template to navbar_plugin_output(), which Boost Union's navbar prints immediately before the user
    menu, and empties the user menu for the same visitors; every decision is
    theme_dimensions\local\guestnav's.

    "Log in" is the one action kept below the md breakpoint, where the navbar has no room for a
    label: the chip and "Create account" are hidden there, and the mobile drawer's card
    (theme_dimensions/navbar_guest_card) offers both. The chip is the guest account's alone, as
    core's sentence is; its dropdown is aligned to the end because Bootstrap positions no dropdown
    inside a .navbar.

    Context variables required for this template (described without braces, because a Mustache
    comment closes at the first pair of closing braces it meets):

    * loginurl - Core's login page, plain
    * hassignup - Whether the site takes sign-ups (core's signup_is_enabled())
    * signupurl - Core's sign-up page, plain; empty without sign-ups
    * isguest - Whether the session is the guest account's

    Example context (json):
    {
        "loginurl": "https://example.com/login/index.php",
        "hassignup": true,
        "signupurl": "https://example.com/login/signup.php",
        "isguest": true
    }
}}
<div class="dimensions-guestnav d-flex align-items-center" data-region="dimensions-guestnav">
    {{#isguest}}
    <div class="dropdown d-none d-md-flex align-items-center">
        <button type="button" class="btn dimensions-guestnav-chip" id="dimensions-guestnav-chip-{{uniqid}}"
            data-bs-toggle="dropdown" aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="false"
            aria-controls="dimensions-guestnav-menu-{{uniqid}}" aria-label="{{#str}} guestnav_chip_label, theme_dimensions {{/str}}">
            <span class="dimensions-guestnav-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span>{{#str}} guestnav_chip, theme_dimensions {{/str}}</span>
        </button>
        <div class="dropdown-menu dropdown-menu-end dimensions-guestnav-menu" id="dimensions-guestnav-menu-{{uniqid}}"
            aria-labelledby="dimensions-guestnav-chip-{{uniqid}}">
            <p class="dimensions-guestnav-menu-title">{{#str}} loggedinasguest, core {{/str}}</p>
            <p class="dimensions-guestnav-menu-text">{{#str}} guestnav_explain, theme_dimensions {{/str}}</p>
            <div class="dimensions-guestnav-menu-actions">
                <a class="btn dimensions-guestnav-login" href="{{loginurl}}">{{#str}} login, core {{/str}}</a>
                {{#hassignup}}
                <a class="btn dimensions-guestnav-signup" href="{{signupurl}}">{{#str}} guestnav_signup, theme_dimensions {{/str}}</a>
                {{/hassignup}}
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    {{/isguest}}
    <a class="btn dimensions-guestnav-login" href="{{loginurl}}" data-region="dimensions-guestnav-login">{{#str}} login, core {{/str}}</a>
    {{#hassignup}}
    <a class="btn dimensions-guestnav-signup d-none d-md-inline-flex" href="{{signupurl}}"
        data-region="dimensions-guestnav-signup">{{#str}} guestnav_signup, theme_dimensions {{/str}}</a>
    {{/hassignup}}
</div>
